			"notes": "- Added more poses from MPM. Expression variables for them are: `hugging`, `dancing`, `waving`, `bowing`, `wagging`, `crying`, `pointing`, `yesPose`, `noPose`\n- Fixed UV mirroring of quads. _Pro tip: to invert quad normal just rotate it 180 degrees._\n- Fixed config. Now it actually works and saves last used shape.\n- Removed UTF-8 decoding from shape JSON decoding. This should help with UTF-8 BOM which is not UTF-8 character aparently.\n- Tinker with skin loading and invalidation. _Pro tip: when you change shape your skin reloads for everyone._"
		},
